 in a database table that comes from another table (also know as the "referenced table") and whose values match the primary key (PK) or unique key in the referenced table.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="54700">foreign key</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="467461">फॉरीन कळ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11508_54701_467461"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A key in a database table that comes from another table (also know as the "referenced table") and whose values match the primary key (PK) or unique key in the referenced table.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="54701">referencing key</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="467461">फॉरीन कळ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11515_27557_1268899"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The use of a capital letter in writing or printing.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="27557">capitalization</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1268899">कॅपिटल अक्षर वापरावे</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote