ion to occur, usually by clicking OK.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="629941">confirmation dialog box</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1959122">पुष्टीकरण संवाद बॉक्स</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16960_629944_1959168"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A three-digit string of numbers, such as 5.1.2., that indicates the status of an attempt to deliver an email message.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="629944">DSN code</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1959168">DSN कोड</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16962_629946_1959171"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The value that is applied to a specific DWORD.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="629946">DWORD value</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1959171">DWORD मूल्य</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16963_629993_1879647"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A unique view for displaying appointments, tasks, and other information in the form of a Web page. You can customize the Outlook Today page for your organization, or for individuals or groups within your organization, to display the information most relevant to them.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="629993">Outlook Today</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1879647">Outlook Today</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="170_502935_1206084"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A part of the user interface dedicated to a particular purpose, such as "instant message area."</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="502935">area</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1206084">स्थळ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="170_502935_1268388"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A part of the user interface dedicated to a particular purpose, such as "instant message area."</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="502935">area</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp