 allows users to display Word documents on a phone’s browser. A file is rendered as an HTML page with sufficient fidelity to convey text and images on a small screen.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1048367">Word Mobile Viewer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1463585">Word मोबाइल व्ह्यूअर</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2257_183896_1268401"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that enables the user to compact or collapse rows when viewing several levels of data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="183896">compact row axis</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1268401">संक्षिप्त पंक्तिचा अक्ष</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22595_1050253_1206485"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Windows Media Player (WMP) specific feature that allows you to use the Internet to access music, pictures and videos available on your home network. The feature must be activated on at least two computers in order to work.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1050253">remote media connection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSe