 shortcuts, descriptions, and other information about Web pages and items on a SharePoint site or the Internet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1115335">social data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1879812">सामाजिक डेटा</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24224_1115342_1879813"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A statistic that indicates the degree to which a computer, server farm, or server cluster meets usage demands for that configuration.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1115342">quality-of-service indicator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1879813">सेवेच्या गुणवत्तेचे सूचक</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24245_1117153_2290207"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An installation package that the user downloads from http://download.live.com/?mkt=en-us.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1117153">download</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2290207">डाउनलोड करा</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammatical