uter or other devices by voice. You can dictate documents and emails in mainstream applications, and use voice commands to start and switch between applications, control the operating system and even fill out forms on the web.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1167216">Windows Speech Recognition</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2263668">Windows उच्चारण ओळख</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25008_1765219_1766712"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A text-based post on Twitter.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1765219">Tweet</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1766712">ट्विट</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25008_2060482_1766712"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A text-based post on Twitter.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2060482">tweet</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1766712">ट्विट</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2502_179897_468176"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A node with subordinate node(s), called children.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="179897">parent node</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="468176">पॅरेंट नोड</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25060_1167275_1879829"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An item in the global address list that provides an easy way to send messages to a group of people. A public group can include any item from a global address list, including other public groups.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1167275">public group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1879829">सार्वजनिक समूह</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25061_1167276_2926641"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A process used to try to locate the name of a person, from a directory or other information store, based on a telephone number.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1167276">reverse number lookup</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet x