ations that are for user-based license as well as signed by Windows Store to be installed/run on Windows 8.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1612750">Microsoft License Terms for Consumers</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1641419">ग्राहकांसाठी Microsoft परवाना अटी</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31693_1612753_1641413"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Windows 8 all windows portal experiences support and persist Live ID logins streamlining the partner experience when working with multiple services and sites.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1612753">Microsoft account logins</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1641413">Microsoft खाते लॉगिन्स</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31698_1612764_1641623"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of notification sent via the Microsoft Push Notification Service to an app running on Windows Phone. The format and meaning of the data is determined by the app.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1612764">raw notification</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig