 or other legal purposes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1647359">preservation hold library</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1880067">संरक्षण धारण लायब्ररी</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32287_1647731_1880068"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An attack where a malicious website makes an HTTP request to a target website in such a way that the website thinks that the request is part of a legitimate user’s session.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1647731">cross-site request forgery</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1880068">क्रॉस-साइट विनंतीची बनावट कृती</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32287_1647731_1880069"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An attack where a malicious website makes an HTTP request to a target website in such a way that the website thinks that the request is part of a legitimate user’s session.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1647731">cross-site request forgery</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1880069">CSRF</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote>