 फिल्टर्स</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40621_2357849_2360919"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows users to tag emails by using # followed by a keyword within the message and that enables users to view all emails tagged with that keyword in their email account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2357849">Hashtags</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2360919">हॅशटॅग्स</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40632_2358041_2359890"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The category of apps or games that are selected based on downloads, usage, and revenue over a 7-day period and ranks them according to those metrics.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2358041">Most popular</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2359890">जास्तीत जास्त लोकप्रिय</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40633_2358042_2359889"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The category for items that are in the top 1000 items based on sales.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2358042">Best selling</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2359889">सर्वाधिक विक्री होणारे</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40652_2358625_2359893"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The view of a particular contact within the People app that shows all your past communication, upcoming meetings, status updates, and files you share with that person. ​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2358625">Timeline</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2359893">समयरेखा</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40653_2358634_2436201"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To remove a shortcut to an application or part of an application from the Start screen (the full screen view of Start) or Start menu.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2358634">unpin from Start</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2436201">प्रारंभ करा अनपिन करा</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOf