ack protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3019850">HSP</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50521_3019770_3019850"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows Shadow Stack security feature that prevents a class of vulnerabilities known as Return-Oriented Programming (ROP) and requires hardware in order to work.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3019770">HSP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3019850">HSP</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50539_2862041_2862562"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A web-hosted technology product such as file storage, webmail, search engines, and calendar management.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862041">service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862562">सेवा</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50540_2862042_2862560"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft web-hosted technology product such as Bing, MSN, OneDrive, Outlook.com, Devices, and Profile, all of which are accessed via a Microsoft account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862042">Microsoft Service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862560">Microsoft सेवा</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50543_2862396_2952963"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The personalized information stream feature of Microsoft Launcher that includes news, events from the user's calendar, photos, notes, contacts, recently-launched apps, and more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862396">feed</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2952963">फीड</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50544_2862397_2952965"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft Launcher page consisting of a card that has been pinned to the Home screen providing a full-screen experience to card users with all filters and sorting preserved as of the moment the page was pinned.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862397">pinned page</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2952965">पिन केलेले पृष्ठ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50547_2862401_2862745"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature in Microsoft Edge that notifies users whenever a password that they have saved through the browser has been identified as compromised.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862401">Password Monitor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862745">पासवर्ड मॉनिटर</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50548_2862405_2862747"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Edge feature that allows users to select, copy, and paste content that they find across the Web while maintaining the source site's formatting, spacing, and text so the copy looks like the original.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862405">Smart copy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862747">स्मार्ट कॉपी</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50549_2862409_2862748"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that lets Microsoft Edge users move their horizontal tabs at the top of the browser to a vertical pane at the right side of their screen.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862409">vertical tabs</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862748">उभे टॅब्स</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50559_2862649_2862750"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of renewing one's energy over the course of a full night's sleep.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862649">nightly recharge</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862750">रात्रीचे रिचार्ज</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50560_2862871_2952962"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A section of the UI in which the user can store interface elements such as links to apps, folders, or messages in order to keep them in an easily accessible location.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862871">dock</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2952962">डॉक</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50572_2864258_2864262"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A daily personalized email sent by Cortana to Office 365 users containing tasks and commitments made by the user, a summary of the user's meetings, and relevant documents for the user's day, all using information extracted from the user's Office 365 messages.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2864258">Cortana Briefing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2864262">Cortana ब्रीफिंग</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50572_2864258_2864263"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A daily personalized email sent by Cortana to Office 365 users containing tasks and commitments made by the user, a summary of the user's meetings, and relevant documents for the user's day, all using information extracted from the user's Office 365 messages.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2864258">Cortana Briefing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2864263">Cortana ब्रीफिंग ईमेल</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50572_2864259_2864262"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A daily personalized email sent by Cortana to Office 365 users containing tasks and commitments made by the user, a summary of the user's meetings, and relevant documents for the user's day, all using information extracted from the user's Office 365 messages.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2864259">Cortana Briefing email</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2864262">Cortana ब्रीफिंग</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50572_2864259_2864263"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A daily personalized email sent by Cortana to Office 365 users containing tasks and commitments made by the user, a summary of the user's meetings, and relevant documents for the user's day, all using information extracted from the user's Office 365 messages.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2864259">Cortana Briefing email</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2864263">Cortana ब्रीफिंग ईमेल</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50578_2864897_2864968"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that protects sensitive information on disk and makes it inaccessible to attackers when the device is locked using encryption keys that are temporarily wiped from the device and only made available when the device is unlocked.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2864897">personal information encryption</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2864968">वैयक्तिक माहिती एनक्रिप्शन</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50578_2864898_2864968"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that protects sensitive information on disk and makes it inaccessible to attackers when the device is locked using encryption keys that are temporarily wiped from the device and only made available when the device is unlocked.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2864898">Data Protection under Lock</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2864968">वैयक्तिक माहिती एनक्रिप्शन</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50578_2864899_2864968"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that protects sensitive information on disk and makes it inaccessible to attackers when the device is locked using encryption keys that are temporarily wiped from the device and only made available when the device is unlocked.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2864899">DPL</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2864968">वैयक्तिक माहिती एनक्रिप्शन</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50579_2864948_2864967"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The option in Microsoft Photos that allows the user to adjust the brightest part of a photo to be either darker or brighter.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2864948">Highlights</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2864967">हायलाइट्स</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50591_2865796_2865831"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A headless app in the Microsoft Store that contains OpenGL and OpenCL API mapping layers on top of DirectX 12 that enable OpenCL and OpenGL apps to run with GPU acceleration in environments where there is no IHV OpenCL or OpenGL driver (for example, on Windows 10 ARM-based PCs).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2865796">OpenCL™ and OpenGL® Compatibility Pack</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2865831">OpenCL™ आणि OpenGL® सुसंगतता पॅक</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5060_129154_467907"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In relational database management systems, a logical table created through the specification of one or more relational operations on one or more tables. A view is equivalent to a divided relation in the relational model.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="129154">view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="467907">दृश्य</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50607_2866400_2866436"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The search function in Microsoft Edge that lets users select text or images on web pages, then open the right-click context menu to search and view results in a sidebar to the right of the browser tab while keeping the current website visible.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2866400">sidebar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2866436">साइडबार</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50666_2867744_2867750"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The option in Microsoft Edge in which a customer can copy a URL and paste as a visual link, which provides a card with a key image and title, as well as additional information from the page where available.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2867744">web preview</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2867750">वेब पुर्वावलोकन</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50672_2868545_2868665"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Two apps that are grouped together by the customer, so both apps open at the same time.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2868545">app group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2868665">अनुप्रयोग समूह</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50673_2868546_2868687"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To enlarge an app on a dual-screen device so that it goes across both screens.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2868546">maximize</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2868687">मोठे करा</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50674_2868547_2868684"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To reorient a dual-screen device that is folded in order to see the other screen.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2868547">flip</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2868684">फ्लिप करा</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50675_2868548_2868685"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To move one screen of a dual-screen device backward.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2868548">fold</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2868685">फोल्ड करा</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50679_2868550_2868668"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An app that has been designed specifically for dual-screen devices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2868550">Dual-screen enhanced app</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2868668">दुहेरी-स्क्रीन वर्धित अनुप्रयोग</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50681_2868552_2868671"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The hinge that holds the two screens together on the Surface Duo dual-screen device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2868552">Dynamic 360° Hinge</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2868671">Dynamic 360° Hinge</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5069_160054_468130"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A technique for converting a color in one color space to another color space. Typically, this conversion is from YUV colors from a video source to RGB for display.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="160054">color-space conversion</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="468130">रंग-स्थान रुपांतर</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5069_210048_468130"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A technique for converting a color in one color space to another color space. Typically, this conversion is from YUV colors from a video source to RGB for display.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="210048">color space conversion</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="468130">रंग-स्थान रुपांतर</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5070_346942_468948"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To provide or give.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="346942">deliver</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="468948">वितरीत करा</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50705_2870079_2871121"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office servicing option in which new features are made available for previewing before they are released in Current Channel.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2870079">Current Channel (Preview)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2871121">सद्य चॅनेल (पुर्वावलोकन)</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50706_2870080_2871123"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office servicing option in which new features are made available for installation once a month, on the 2nd Tuesday of the month.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2870080">Monthly Enterprise Channel</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2871123">मासिक एंटरप्राइझ चॅनेल</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50707_2870081_2871125"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office servicing option in which new features are made available for previewing four months before they are released in Semi-Annual Enterprise Channel.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2870081">Semi-Annual Enterprise Channel (Preview)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2871125">अर्ध-वार्षिक एंटरप्राइझ चॅनेल (पुर्वावलोकन)</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50708_2870082_2871124"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office servicing option in which new features are made available for installation twice a year, on the 2nd Tuesday in January and July.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2870082">Semi-Annual Enterprise Channel</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2871124">अर्ध-वार्षिक एंटरप्राइझ चॅनेल</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5071_119170_467855"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A character used to align lines and columns on screen and in print. Although a tab is visually indistinguishable from a series of blank spaces in most programs, the tab character and the space character are different to a computer. A tab is a single character and therefore can be added, deleted, or overtyped with a single keystroke.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="119170">tab character</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="467855">टॅब वर्ण</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50717_2870996_2871150"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Descriptive phrasing to be used when an app or accessory is compatible with Windows.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2870996">works with Windows</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2871150">Windows सह कार्य करते</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5072_138277_467977"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In a shared file, information that is maintained about changes made in past editing sessions. The information includes the name of the person who made each change, when the change was made, and what data was changed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="138277">change history</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="467977">बदल इतिहास</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5074_307449_1959334"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A normalized value assigned to an email message that indicates, based on the characteristics of the message, the likelihood that the message is spam and that is persisted with the message when the message is sent to other Exchange servers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="307449">spam confidence level</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1959334">SCL</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5074_307449_1959350"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A normalized value assigned to an email message that indicates, based on the characteristics of the message, the likelihood that the message is spam and that is persisted with the message when the message is sent to other Exchange servers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="307449">spam confidence level</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1959350">स्‍पॅम विश्‍वास पातळी</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5074_307468_1959334"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A normalized value assigned to an email message that indicates, based on the characteristics of the message, the likelihood that the message is spam and that is persisted with the message when the message is sent to other Exchange servers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="307468">SCL</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1959334">SCL</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5074_307468_1959350"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A normalized value assigned to an email message that indicates, based on the characteristics of the message, the likelihood that the message is spam and that is persisted with the message when the message is sent to other Exchange servers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="307468">SCL</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1959350">स्‍पॅम विश्‍वास पातळी</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50751_2871535_2871574"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft tool designed to help developers discover, install, upgrade, remove, and configure their Windows tools.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2871535">Windows Package Manager</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2871574">Windows पॅकेज व्यवस्थापक</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50752_2871540_2871577"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The command line that developers use to retrieve the specified window's unique ID, process ID, process name, or a list of its controls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2871540">WinGet</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2871577">WinGet</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50756_2873197_2873224"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The release channel for early adopters and developers in which client builds are available to the subscriber early in the development cycle with the newest code, which is typically weekly or bi-weekly.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2873197">Beta Channel</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2873224">बीटा चॅनेल</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50765_2873527_2873744"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft 365 subsite for SMBs that features resources to help them start, manage and grow their business.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2873527">Business Insights &amp; Ideas</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2873744">व्यवसाय अंतर्दृष्टी आणि कल्पना</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5077_1546384_467705"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A portion of a software window bounded by and separated from other portions by vertical or horizontal bars and having a separate function.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1546384">window pane</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="467705">उपखंड</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5077_90456_467705"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A portion of a software window bounded by and separated from other portions by vertical or horizontal bars and having a separate function.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="90456">pane</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="467705">उपखंड</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50777_2873906_2873918"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The interface in Microsoft Edge that allows users to customize their browser's appearance, privacy &amp; security options, and other configuration options.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2873906">Settings</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2873918">सेटिंग्‍ज</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50778_2873907_2873920"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The video camera capture mode for in which users can take slow-motion videos.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2873907">Slow-mo</term><termNote type="partO