the customer know how vulnerable devices in their organization are.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2893120">exposure score</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2893122">एक्सपोजर स्कोअर</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51338_2893964_2894299"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft 365 Teams background effect that is limited only to uploading the user's own images.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2893964">custom background</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2894299">सानुकूल पार्श्वभूमी</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51339_2893965_2894301"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Xbox Live matchmaking service that groups players based on user information and the request for any users who want to play together.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2893965">SmartMatch</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2894301">SmartMatch</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNo