person's default space in the Mesh app for HoloLens, private and only accessible by its owner.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3000145">home space</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3000233">घराची जागा</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52794_3000146_3000232"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A space in which multiple people connect and collaborate together in the Mesh app for HoloLens.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3000146">collaborative space</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3000232">सहयोगी जागा</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52795_3000147_3000241"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A location in mixed reality that persists, contains content (models, ink, images, etc), supports real-time presence of the members of the space, and can be bound to one (or more) locations in the real world.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3000147">space</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3000241">जागा</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</term