 employee in an organization that helps driving engagement and business transformation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3055638">champion</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3056023">चॅम्पियन</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53676_3055644_3056024"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature in Champion Management Platform that allows users to track campaigns across the champion group to see their ranking from a global perspective.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3055644">Champion Leaderboard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3056024">चॅम्पियन लीडरबोर्ड</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53676_3055644_3056027"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature in Champion Management Platform that allows users to track campaigns across the champion group to see their ranking from a global perspective.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3055644">Champion Leaderboard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3056027">लीडरबोर्ड</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage