 function that specifies the last, or ending, date of the period.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3080960">end_date</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3082567">समाप्ती_तारीख</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5405_77118_467611"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of keystrokes and instructions recorded and saved as a key combination (such as CTRL + X) or file name. When the macro is used, all of the recorded steps are performed automatically. Macros save time by replacing a series of frequently performed steps with a simple key combination or name.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="77118">macro</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="467611">मॅक्रो</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54050_3080961_3082565"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The argument in the DATEVALUE Excel function that represents a date in an Excel date format, or a reference to a cell that contains text that represents a date in an Excel date format.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3080961">date_text</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSe