e in which users fill out forms when working offline.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="269749">offline mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="468562">ऑफलाइन मोड</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5728_25995_467219"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A device that enables a broadband connection to the Internet by using cable television infrastructure. Access speeds vary greatly, with a maximum throughput of 10 megabits per second (Mbps).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="25995">cable modem</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="467219">केबल मॉडेम</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="573_231958_468289"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of coordinates that a cell occupies on a worksheet. For example, the reference of the cell that appears at the intersection of column B and row 3 is B3.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="231958">cell reference</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="mr"><ntig><termGrp><term id="468289">कक्ष संदर्भ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><